# an example calibration: the skin NTC in water baths, next to a
# reference thermometer (these points are made up: the MF58 curve)
bridge 3.3 47000 47000 10000   # supply V, R above the NTC, R above / below the reference
25118 0.0                      # ADC code (cat /dev/ntc/skin), reference C
0 25.0
-5625 35.0
-6521 37.0
-9497 45.0
